B.XA=new A.ie("BAZINGA","bazinga","One clean sweep and everything on screen goes with it. Say it like you mean it.","Common")
B.Xv=new A.ie("MANA","mana","A blessing straight to your countdown. Take the gift, keep both feet on the ground and never forget.","Uncommon")
B.Xw=new A.ie("TIMER PAUSE","timerpause","Buys you a moment that shouldn't exist. The clock stops, but only for you.","Uncommon")
B.Xu=new A.ie("GENTO","gento","Everything it touches turns to gold. Doesn't last forever, so move fast.","Uncommon")
B.XC=new A.ie("8TONBALL","8tonball","Let something heavier do the work for a while. It doesn't ask twice, and it doesn't miss.","Rare")
B.XB=new A.ie("WYAT","wyat","Keeps asking the same question. Answer right and it pays out, answer wrong and it costs you.","Rare")
B.Xy=new A.ie("WHAT","what","Confusion has a color scheme, and it's already been memorized. You'll figure it out. Maybe.","Rare")
B.Xz=new A.ie("SFTS","sfts","Reach for the stars. Just make sure you're shooting at the right one.","Rare")
B.XE=new A.ie("CRIMZONE","crimzone","Not everything in the red zone is worth the same. Distance has a price.","Rare")
B.Xx=new A.ie("WMIAN","wmian","Don't forrow your eyebrows. They're all coming to you now, big and small alike.","Legendary")
B.XD=new A.ie("QUIT","quit","You don't get to hear this one until you've already proven your worth. It's a one-time deal, so make it count.","Mythic")
